    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are thrilled to present this exceptional 2-bedroom duplex nestled in the prestigious Drury Mills Development, Saggart.\nNo.10 Drury Park comes to the market in turn key condition throughout.\nBoasting an impressive c.113 sq m of bright and spacious living space split over two floors, this home offers a welcoming entrance hallway, open plan lounge/kitchen/dining area, a utility room, downstairs bathroom, 2 generous double bedrooms, both with ensuites.\nNo.10 is further enhanced by two balcony's leading off both the main lounge & also the master bedroom.\nSituated in the heart of Saggart Village, this highly sought-after development offers an abundance of conveniences right on your doorstep, including local bars, shops, schools, and parks. Commuters will appreciate the easy access to a variety of bus routes, the red line luas, as well as the nearby N7 and M50 road networks.\nPresented in turnkey condition, No. 10 further benefits from gas-fired central heating, an A3 energy rating & ample storage space. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality of this wonderful home.\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>2 bed, 3 bath</li>\n <li>113sqm</li>\n <li>Own door duplex</li>\n <li>A3 Energy rating/Green mortgage potential</li>\n <li>Turn key condition</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Balcony's leading from the lounge & master bedroom</li>\n <li>Ample parking</li>\n <li>Turn key condition throughout</li>\n <li>Ample storage space</li>\n <li>Easy access to major routes & road networks</li>\n <li>A host of amenities within walking distance</li>\n</ul>\n\nBER details\nBER: A3\nDirections\nEircode: D24 YPX3"
      },
      {
